
                  PLT version 4.22 for MSDOS and Win95

These files demonstrate use of the PLT program on an IBM-PC compatible
microcomputer.  Test the PLT program plotting the files logo.plt,
hc.plt, and star.plt to the screen.  For example, type:

	plt logo hc star

The file wplt.exe is a (noninteractive) Win95 version of the PLT
program.  Refer to the file "plt.man" for further information on use of
the PLT program. 


